# Camp Africa Foly Drum and Dance

**July 19th / 20th 2014[![Camp Africa Foly Drum and Dance](/media/2013/12/image3017-1.png)](/media/2013/12/image3017-1.png)** We are very excited to announce that Rhythm Culture in association with the Noosa Long Weekend Festival will be providing the Sunshine Coast with an extraordinary Drum and Dance Camp in 2014! International and interstate artists have been confirmed and there will be a range of drum and dance workshops for all levels. There will also be private tuition opportunities on balaphon (African xylophone) and Kora (African harp), and an African party (performed by the teachers)  for lovers of African rhythm and music in general. The program is almost finalised and we will be giving you lots more info via our [website](/ "Rhythm Culture") and [Facebook page](https://www.facebook.com/RhythmCultureOZ "Rhythm Culture") over the next few months.  Spaces are limited. We will be announcing the artists early in the New Year, so w[atch this space for more info](https://www.facebook.com/events/645922718791908/?context=create "Camp Africa Foly").
